e IT Remediation Workspace permits remediation owners to view the records \\(VITs, AVITs, CVITs, and TRs\\) assigned to them and their assignment groups, and remediate these vulnerabilities and misconfigurations. You can also view the list of preferred solutions that are recommended for remediating the host vulnerable items \\(VITs\\). Along with these lists, you can view the list of exception requests and penetration test assessment requests raised by you, penetration test findings associated with your penetration test assessment requests, supported libraries and other supported data.","locale":"en-US","canonical_url":"https://www.servicenow.com/docs/r/security-management/it-remediation-workspace/itr-ws-list-page.html","release":"australia","product":"IT Remediation Workspace","classification":"it-remediation-workspace","topic_type":"concept","last_updated":"2026-03-12","reading_time_minutes":7,"breadcrumb":["Exploring the IT Remediation Workspace","IT Remediation Workspace","Vulnerability Response Workspaces","Unified Security Exposure Management","Security Operations"],"tags":["#security-management","#remediation","#workspace","#security","#it","#type-concept"]},"task_lines":[],"tasks":{},"codeblock_ranges":[]},"smart_blocks:ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/it-remediation-workspace/itr-ws-list-page.md#---frontmatter---": {"path":null,"last_embed":{"hash":null},"embeddings":{},"text":null,"length":0,"last_read":{"hash":"ibfh2u","at":1784561351282},"key":"ServiceNowOfficialDocs/security-management/it-remediation-workspace/itr-ws-list-page.md#---frontmatter---","lines":[1,20],"size":1242,"outlinks":[],"class_name":"SmartBlock"},
